    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'To whom it may concern, \n\nI''m still not quite sure how these doors
    work, but I think it might have something to do with the fireplaces. Seeking
    warmth, I used my lighter and some fuel I  found to light the fire. Unfortunately,
    I accidently dropped a gem in while trying to light the fire - or so I thought.
    Surprisingly, the monster which had been chasing me froze, and whatever magic
    which had been cast on that room seemed to be dispelled. \n\nPerhaps I can find
    a way out of here after all.\n\n-M

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
